  "details": "The current IK solver in VRChat expects humanoid legs in the rig to work correctly. This always gives creators of anthropomorphic characters with digitigrade legs (see attached screenshots) headaches.\nIt would be highly appreciated if VRChat could offer an alternative solver for those cases in IK 2.0, so that avatar creators don't need to find hacky workarounds for those anymore. \nI can give my avatar rig to the VRChat devs for testing purposes, if needed.",
